## The records room

::bg{location="hall-of-fame" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="triumphant" volume="up"}
::set{user.hallOfFame += 1}
@profAlder: This is where the League keeps its Champions. Every team that ever won is recorded here.
@narrator: The Hall of Fame records {{userName}} and team. Hall of Fame entry number {{user.hallOfFame}}.
@narrator{when="user.hallOfFame >= 2"}: It is the {{user.hallOfFame:ordinalWord}} time this trainer's name has gone on the wall.
@narrator{when="@dexCaught >= 150"}: Beside the entry, a note in the professor's hand: Dex complete.
@narrator: {{@dexCaught}} kinds caught. {{@dexSeen}} seen. {{@badgeCount}} badges.
::vfx{type="sparkle"}
